# Canonical author names / emails for libchromadec.
#
# Format (per git-mailmap(7)):
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email>      <Old Email>
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email>      Old Name <Old Email>
#
# Populated as authorship variations are encountered. Do not rewrite history
# to apply these; .mailmap is consulted by git log/blame/shortlog at display
# time.
